effect size estimates (Hedges' \(g\)) and adjusted \(-\log_{10}(p)\)
values from step-down max-\(T\) correction. Points are categorized by
significance status (significant after step-down max-\(T\), significant
before adjustment only, or non-significant). The horizontal dotted line
marks the \(\alpha = 0.05\) threshold. The right panel displays the
pairwise correlation matrix of signed standardized statistics (top) and
the empirical density distribution of off-diagonal correlation values
(bottom).}

